# A109 TeraDesk via #Z (sd-tera) — the unchanged-third-party control: the AES
# arrow feedback and the desktop's own menu geometry must not move TeraDesk's
# picture. A: idle. File title (88,8) -> B: box down. Out, click = cancel,
# park -> D.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 88 8
1900 mark B_FILE_OPEN
3000 move 400 300
3300 down
3303 up
3800 parkbr
4300 mark D_CLOSED
